# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder as api_server.py) and paste
# your real key in. Never commit the real ".env" file — it's already
# in .gitignore.
#
# Get a free NVIDIA NIM API key (used to call the Nemotron model):
#   1. Go to https://build.nvidia.com
#   2. Sign in / sign up
#   3. Open any Nemotron model page (e.g. nemotron-3-super) and click
#      "Get API Key"
#   4. Paste the key below

NEMOTRON_API_KEY=your-nvidia-nim-api-key-here
